#. すまんが、我から話せるような進展は、
#. 何もないぞ…
msgctxt "0001 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Sorry, but I don't have any progress to report."
msgstr ""

#. 出口に関しても、
#. この学園の謎に関してもな…
msgctxt "0002 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I haven't found a way out, I haven't solved any of the\n"
"mysteries of this school..."
msgstr ""

#. 一緒に過ごす
msgctxt "0003 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Spend some time with Sakura"
msgstr ""

#. 他の場所へ行く
msgctxt "0004 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Go see who else is around"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうしよう？
#. 大神さんを誘ってみようか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm... Should I talk to Sakura for a while?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ちょうど、さっきまでトレーニングをしていて、
#. 休憩でも取ろうと思っていたところだ。
msgctxt "0006 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I just got done exercising. Now would be a good time\n"
"for a break."
msgstr ""

#. たまにはゆるりと、
#. 茶でも飲みながら語り合うか…
msgctxt "0007 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Would you like to get something to drink and talk for\n"
"a bit?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大神さんと一緒に、
#. 穏やかなティータイムを過ごした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sakura and I sat down for tea and a calm, relaxing\n"
"conversation...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大神さんと少し仲良くなれたみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sakura and I grew a little closer today.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 渡す
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes, definitely"
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Not really, no"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>プレゼント<CLT><CLT 23>を渡しますか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>Would you like to give Sakura a<CLT> <CLT 3>present<CLT><CLT 23>?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
